msgid "To start, ``sudo systemctl start arduplane``. To check on it, ``sudo systemctl status arduplane``. To restart, ``sudo systemctl restart arduplane``. To stop, ``sudo systemctl stop arduplane``. To enable service startup at boot, ``sudo systemctl enable arduplane`` Note that only one build must be running at a time."
msgstr ""
